  "description": "Week 4 of the Bull Market Continues...Hope You're Enjoying It!",
  "body_html": "<p>The week started off a bit scary…threats of WW3, a locally large dip on Friday. But ultimately, there was no signals screaming “sell now”. We stayed calm, held most of our positions… <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$SPOT&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> was stopped out for a ~2% profit. We bought 1 new stock, and added to <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$TTMI&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> which is now up ~10%. Going into next week, pending nothing insane happens this weekend (always a possibility lol),<em><strong> I am optimistic we will have a positive week 5 closeout</strong></em>. Trend is Strong!</p><p>Sometimes people make excuses that the “stock market is rigged…ITS CORRUPT!”. Likely there is truth to this. We see politicians and insiders miraculous trades all the time 🙄. But where this excuse falls short…is a stock’s price action will always tell a story. Provide subtle clues. Institutions buying up stock, will nearly always show higher highs and higher lows. We can see volume moving in. Supply decreasing. This is why we trade volatility contraction patterns in about 99% of our trades! And we’ve done well with that approach. Moral of the story: stop making excuses, and start building a consistent strategy! Happy to help anyone that has questions on this, in the chat.</p><p>Next, my plan is to build a “<em><strong>One-Stop-Shop</strong></em>” Dashboard next week. I know that you all kind of bounce around Substack, and it is a pain sometimes, understandably. All of the <strong>current members, I will import your emails</strong> so that you have immediate access when it is built. You may need to set up a password for yourself, but that’s about it. If you are a web development expert…please drop a comment down below, I may have a question or two as I build (I am not a dev expert! 😅). My main concern will be setting up security first. A lot of bad actors out there. Regardless, I know its just a power point slide now…but this is how I envision the dashboard will look: Tell me if you have suggestions!</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!b-5o!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F05ced212-f7fc-4b14-ad9b-0f6a89850dfa_1600x900.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!b-5o!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F05ced212-f7fc-4b14-ad9b-0f6a89850dfa_1600x900.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!b-5o!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F05ced212-f7fc-4b14-ad9b-0f6a89850dfa_1600x900.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!b-5o!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F05ced212-f7fc-4b14-ad9b-0f6a89850dfa_1600x900.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!b-5o!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F05ced212-f7fc-4b14-ad9b-0f6a89850dfa_1600x900.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!b-5o!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F05ced212-f7fc-4b14-ad9b-0f6a89850dfa_1600x900.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"819\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/05ced212-f7fc-4b14-ad9b-0f6a89850dfa_1600x900.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:819,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:474242,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/167437928?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F05ced212-f7fc-4b14-ad9b-0f6a89850dfa_1600x900.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!b-5o!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F05ced212-f7fc-4b14-ad9b-0f6a89850dfa_1600x900.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!b-5o!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F05ced212-f7fc-4b14-ad9b-0f6a89850dfa_1600x900.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!b-5o!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F05ced212-f7fc-4b14-ad9b-0f6a89850dfa_1600x900.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!b-5o!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F05ced212-f7fc-4b14-ad9b-0f6a89850dfa_1600x900.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">How I envision the dashboard. AI and I will have a date next week building this out. If you have recommendations, drop them in the comments please. </figcaption></figure></div><p> This will have the stocks from the screeners (please note, the short screener is still under development). It will show my positions, quick links to my recent posts, and a economic calendar so you are aware of what is coming up. Please give me time on this…I’m a one man team.</p><p>Finally, we are down to the last 15 spots before I push up Substack price to $49 a month (it is currently $8). We talked about <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/membership-is-growing-fast-and-thats?r=4z8lgl\">too many people being a problem in this post</a>. </p><ul><li><p>We cannot have too many people access the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-daily-update?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Screener</a>, which has clearly demonstrated an edge; we would lose the edge with too many. </p></li><li><p>Additionally, I don’t want a <em><strong>MASSIVE</strong></em> community, I want a tight knit community where we help each other. A community where I can be actively present. I can’t be present for 10’s of thousands of people like on TikTok…where I ignore 99% of comments. Keeping it small, keeps it personal. </p></li></ul><p>If you missed any of these posts, check them out in your free time during the long weekend:</p><ul><li><p> <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/best-stock-to-buy?r=4z8lgl\">Mid-Week Movers: Best Stock to Buy</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-80-stock-market-crash-the-why?r=4z8lgl\">A Speculation On WHY The Stock Market Will Crash</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/prepare-yourself?r=4z8lgl\">Things To Do Now, Before The Bear Market</a></p></li></ul><p>Thank you again for everyone that is here with me, and your support. Hope you have a great weekend, and I will see you on Monday! </p><p><em>Quick-links: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing for Beginners</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/timothys-stocktok-tracker?r=4z8lgl\">Current Stock Positions</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-daily-update?r=4z8lgl\">Daily Stock Screener</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a></strong></em></p><p></p>",
